<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, APRIL 10.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, APRIL 10.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Thursday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	April 10    April 9    Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  269.910     270.190     247.020    9.27 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  307.090     307.490     306.830    0.08 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.095     157.465     158.970   -1.18 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.668	46.802	47.182   -1.09 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  437.700     438.920     419.180    4.42 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.695     140.020     141.685    1.40 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.910	15.948	16.185   -1.70 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  213.950     213.840     212.430    0.72 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.861	 1.865	 1.888   -1.43 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.568	 1.572	 1.581   -0.82 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  183.280     183.845     183.135    0.08 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
